{'symbol': 'BA', 'date': '2022-01-05 09:15:00', 'title': 'ALLEGIANT TRAVEL COMPANY SCHEDULES BOEING 737 INVESTOR CALL', 'text': "LAS VEGAS, JAN. 5, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ALLEGIANT TRAVEL COMPANY (NASDAQ: ALGT) HAS SCHEDULED AN INVESTOR CALL FOR THURSDAY, JAN. 6 AT 12:00 P.M. EDT TO DISCUSS THE AGREEMENT WITH BOEING TO PURCHASE 50 NEW 737 MAX AIRCRAFT AS PART OF THE AIRLINE'S ONGOING EFFORTS TO MODERNIZE AND EXPAND ITS FLEET."}